ect of the direct renin inhibitor aliskiren, the angiotensin receptor blocker losartan, or both on left ventricular mass in patients with hypertension and left ventricular hypertrophy</article-title><source><italic>Circulation</italic></source><year>2009</year><volume>119</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>530</fpage><lpage>537</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19153265</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B90"><label>92</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Parving</surname><given-names>HH</given-names></name><name><surname>Persson</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Lewis</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name><name><surname>Lewis</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Hollenberg</surname><given-names>NK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Aliskiren combined with losartan in type 2 diabetes and nephropathy</article-title><source><italic>New England Journal of Medicine</italic></source><year>2008</year><volume>358</volume><issue>23</issue><fpage>2433</fpage><lpage>2446</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18525041</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B108"><label>93</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jamerson</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Weber</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Bakris</surname><given-names>GL</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Benazepril plus amlodipine or hydrochlorothiazide for hypertension in high-risk patients</article-title><source><italic>New England Journal of Medicine</italic></source><year>2008</year><volume>359</volume><issue>23</issue><fpage>2417</fpage><lpage>2428</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19052124</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B109"><label>94</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author">